WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Ryu begins charging Denjin while the opponent is stunned.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.600
Blue energy fills the screen as Ryu charges Level 2.

3
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.700
Ryu releases the charged Super into Ken in the corner.

4
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.500
Ryu advances with the green Drive Rush effect after the Super.

5
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.800
Ryu launches Ken with the medium Hashogeki follow-up.

6
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.650
Ryu rises into the final Shoryuken juggle.
